#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "401\t511"
msgid "Not such a big man now, are you?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasó con toda esa energía de antes, eh?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "633\t708"
msgid "Don't give me that look."
msgstr "¿Por qué me miras así?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "709\t787"
msgid "You want more!?"
msgstr "¡¿Todavía no has tenido suficiente?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "961\t1024"
msgid "Hey, Saito."
msgstr "Oi, Saito."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1043\t1112"
msgid "Listen to me, Saito."
msgstr "¡Oi, Saito!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1114\t1174"
msgid "Saito!"
msgstr "¡Saito!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1195\t1255"
msgid "That's enough."
msgstr "Ya fue suficiente."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1369\t1443"
msgid "Goddamn. He's a freak of nature!"
msgstr "¡Mierda! ¿De qué diablos está hecho este tipo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1446\t1521"
msgid "Not one who's scheduled for execution today."
msgstr "Hoy no es su día de ejecución, ¿o sí?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1530\t1580"
msgid "Lay off him."
msgstr "Ya déjalo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1675\t1774"
msgid "What for? Who cares if he lives or dies?"
msgstr "¿Y por qué? ¿Qué tendría de malo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1775\t1840"
msgid "Nobody's gonna miss this human trash."
msgstr "Nadie va a extrañar a basura como esta..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1841\t1946"
msgid "That would make three prisoners\\nwho have died under your watch."
msgstr "El mes pasado también mataste a\\ndos tipos de la misma manera, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1939\t1999"
msgid "You can't keep doing this."
msgstr "Te estás pasando de la raya."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2022\t2082"
msgid "Fuck off!"
msgstr "¡Mierda!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2090\t2162"
msgid "It's your lucky day, freak."
msgstr "Te has salvado por hoy."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2656\t2755"
msgid "You've got a visitor."
msgstr "Alguien ha venido a verte."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3169\t3259"
msgid "This little favor'll cost you."
msgstr "Este favor te va a salir caro."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3285\t3467"
msgid "I got friends on the outside.\\nSure they'd be glad to slip a cool mil into your account."
msgstr "Ordenaré que alguien de afuera\\ntransfiera \"un millóncito\" a tu cuenta."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3468\t3528"
msgid "That enough for you?"
msgstr "¿Te parece bien?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3551\t3616"
msgid "I'll take it."
msgstr "Justo le toca revisión a mi coche."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3610\t3765"
msgid "I was just thinking of getting\\na nice new car, too. Thanks for the help."
msgstr "Aunque con esto mejor lo cambio por uno nuevo. Me viene de maravilla."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3815\t3887"
msgid "Now, clock's ticking."
msgstr "No tardes mucho."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3892\t3952"
msgid "Tick, tock."
msgstr "Nos vemos..."

